WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:11.300
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:22.310
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.790
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:38.250
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.300
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:44.590
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.470
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.680
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:01.350
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:10.030
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:17.030
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:22.500
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.670
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:40.020
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:43.650
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.360
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.130
After acquiring
the Rune-God Selece...

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:55.000
...they continued their journey
for the other two Rune-Gods.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.740
In the process,
Umi and Fuu were abducted...

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.310
...when a monster of light attacked.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.120
Hikaru faced
the mysterious monster by herself.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:12.020
Keeping the wish deep in her heart
that the three become Magic Knights...

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.490
...she fought and
defeated the monster.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:20.560
The Second Rune-God:
Windam, the Lord of the Skies

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.440
What is it, Inouva?

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:34.070
I am sorry to bother you
during your time of rest.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.880
The Magic Knights are
about to reach the Sky Shrine...

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:41.580
...where the Rune-God
Windam sleeps.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:47.050
My lord, please grant me
permission to defeat them.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.600
Alcyone, Ascot, and Caldina
have already been defeated.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:01.030
Please send me
to where the Magic Knights are.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.830
Inouva...

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:07.450
I will be sure to return here with
news of the Magic Knights' defeat.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.910
To grant your ultimate wish, my lord.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.110
Please, send me to where
the Magic Knights are...

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.650
I am truly sorry.
I have said too much.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:26.860
Are you saying you have been at my
side despite knowing my true intent?

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:28.600
Yes.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.330
Go.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.610
Yes!

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.410
This is some storm...

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.960
We were lucky we found this cave.

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:54.460
Fuu, if you keep
standing there, you'll get wet!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.900
Come over here, Fuu!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.490
Right...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.040
What's going on? It was such
nice weather until a moment ago.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.740
Is this another sign
that Cephiro is crumbling?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.950
Quit saying stuff like that!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:24.720
But Clef did say how Cephiro
had mild weather all the time.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.260
Clef hasn't talked to us lately...
I wonder if he's okay.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.500
That was dangerous...

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.440
This is no joke.
I can't just die off here!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.440
Fuu, can you hear me?

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.040
Fuu! Fuu!

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.190
Ferio!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.610
Are you all right?
Where are you right now?

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:01.460
Somewhere with a great view,
but I can't say I'm all right.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:04.620
I'm in a slight bind
because the wind's so strong.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.720
Let me join up with you.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:11.630
Sure. We are taking shelter in
a cave right below the Sky Shrine.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.230
Take care...
I hope you will arrive here safely.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.470
Gotcha.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.740
You're a lifesaver. See ya.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:21.780
Hey, you look so happy!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.820
A woman?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.860
Hey, are you all right?

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.830
Hang on... Just hang on.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.330
The medicinal herbs...

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.460
Medicinal herbs?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.440
Ferio!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.030
Her fever's gone down quite a bit.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.790
She'll be all right now.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.330
Who is this?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.760
I don't know. I found her collapsed.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:22.040
And you, why did you
come chasing after us?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.180
To see my lovely Fuu of course...

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.380
Well, I had something
I wanted to tell you.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.610
To tell the truth...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.320
She's coming to.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.950
Where am...

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.650
The medicinal herbs...

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.230
Where are the medicinal herbs?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.930
Don't worry. I gathered them
all up and brought them here.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:56.400
My name is Sera. I live in the town
at the foot of these mountains.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:00.950
My brother got a sudden fever,
so I came to collect medicinal herbs.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:04.880
And then with this
sudden rain... I couldn't go back...

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.850
What would've
happened if you weren't here?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.320
Thank you all for saving me.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.060
N-Not at all.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.590
It was good that Ferio passed by.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.720
Let's all wait here
for the storm to pass.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.030
The "storm"?

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.470
What's that?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.400
You know, a storm. Like today...

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.730
There's lots of wind and
thunder, an eye in the center...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.370
...and clouds surround it and roar.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.770
Such an incredible monster exists?

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.940
Roar

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.280
No!

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:44.650
There aren't any storms in Cephiro?

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:45.730
Nope.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.830
I've never seen the skies
thrash about like this before.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:54.700
Have you heard from Clef lately?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.740
Cephiro has had monsters
in its times of peace.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.570
But weather...

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.440
Cephiro has started to rapidly
crumble the past couple of days.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.610
And at an alarming rate.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:21.960
Please hurry.
Cephiro doesn't have much time left!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.360
I came here to tell you guys that.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:30.900
Well, the sun's about to set. You all
should rest till the storm passes.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.630
What about you, Ferio?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.710
I'll stay awake and watch
what goes on outside.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.800
I want to observe this
rare "storm" thing closely.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:57.130
Fe...

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.360
Fe...
Sera.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.330
What's wrong? You can't sleep?

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.740
Yes...

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.300
I'm kind of scared...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.910
Is it true that Cephiro
is about to crumble?

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:09.980
Yeah.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.440
But it'll be all right.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.570
You'll feel better after
you have some soup.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:20.620
Then use the herbs I picked
along with the medicinal herbs.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:21.810
Let's see...

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.380
It's great!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.480
I'm glad.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.460
Does this serve well as thanks?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:35.660
If you make soup this good, I'll save
you as many times as you want.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:37.700
You're so easygoing.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.460
Hey, look! The storm's passed!

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.140
We can get going now!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.780
Whoops.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.250
Guess I fell asleep...

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:52.720
Ferio!

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:53.980
Ferio!
Hold on!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.010
Thanks.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.150
I'm all right though...

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.390
Oh no. You have a fever.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.160
It must be from last night's rain.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.430
Leave Ferio to me.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:11.300
You all have a mission
that must be accomplished quickly.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.670
Then we'll be going.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.240
Let's go, Fuu.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.870
Well then...

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.580
Fuu!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.580
You...

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.620
What's with the weird looks lately?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:31.920
Come on...

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.290
Don't think of unimportant things.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.960
Just think about saving Cephiro!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.460
I know that already!

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:46.200
I know that you can save Cephiro.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:50.240
I believe in you.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.440
I believe in you.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.550
I understand.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.680
I will make sure
to return with the Rune-God.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:02.720
Ms. Sera.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:06.380
Please take good care of Ferio!

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.590
R-Right.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.960
Well, let us be on our way!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.260
Yeah...

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.610
What the hell has happened to me?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:30.110
M-My body is refusing to do as I say...

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:38.020
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:43.990
There is a strong bond
between you and Fuu, Ferio.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.900
W-What are you saying?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:54.870
And how will you feel as your
Fuu dies in front of your eyes?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.640
W-What?

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.940
You're...

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.150
Did you like the taste...

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.110
...of my special herb?

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.650
You!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.420
You're one of Zagato's minions?

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:18.790
Thanks to you, I know the weakness
of one of the Magic Knights.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.560
Since you're stuck there...

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:27.400
...you can only kick yourself as you
watch as the Magic Knights die.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:35.310
As that girl named Fuu dies,
calling the name of the man she loves.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.720
Damn it all...

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.320
Damn it all!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:51.230
If you had this ride,
why didn't you give it to us earlier?

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.900
This isn't very stable
after that attack by Zagato.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.320
Fuu...

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.480
Fuu...
Fuu.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.650
It is calling me.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.320
The Rune-God is calling me...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.230
Fuu...

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:29.270
Fuu!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.100
S-She disappeared...

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.640
It's all right.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:37.510
You were spaced out too when
you found the Rune-God Selece.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.970
I'm sure the Rune-God
that's here is calling Fuu.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.980
R-Right...

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.640
We should go in too.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.750
Wait, Hikaru!

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:58.060
That is where
you stop, Magic Knights.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.600
It looks like you're not out to greet us.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.060
How futile.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.830
Legendary Magic Knight.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:18.980
One that doth come to
this shrine to don me.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.350
You are...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.720
My name is Windam.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.620
I am the Rune-God
that sleeps here...

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.760
...waiting for the one that
will become a Magic Knight.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.230
This is the Rune-God?

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:41.370
This enormous bird?

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.400
One that has come here to don me.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.510
Show me the strength of thine heart.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:55.080
Show before me proof that thy power
makes thee worthy of donning me.

00:14:56.820 --> 00:15:01.420
The strength of thine heart worthy of
becoming a legendary Magic Knight.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:06.350
The strength of my heart...

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.600
How in the world do I...

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.330
Ms. Umi!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.010
Are you all right?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.680
Please hold on!

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:23.110
Fuu, I'm sorry...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.120
I couldn't protect you to the end...

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.620
Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:36.190
They are too weak.
Not even worth mentioning.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:38.250
Who are you?

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.560
My name is Inouva.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:45.100
I stand here with an order from
Lord Zagato to kill the Magic Knights.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.810
You did this
to Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi?

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.710
It's useless.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.150
M-My sword does not work?

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.990
I told you that it was useless.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:20.430
If I had known it would be this easy,
I wouldn't have taken a hostage.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.340
Hostage?

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.880
I mean that stupid little boy.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.450
Ferio!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.080
As I thought.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.420
You do have special
feelings toward him.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.190
As you thought?
How did you know about Ferio?

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.600
You are...

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.760
Ms. Sera?

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.600
Fuu...

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:59.770
If you kneel before me now and
swear not to become a Magic Knight...

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:02.750
...I will spare this boy's life.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.680
Ferio...

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.120
Is it not painful to see him like this?

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:14.560
If I wish to do so,
I can rip his body apart as well.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.160
Say it.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.630
That you will not
become a Magic Knight.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:21.760
Say it!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.330
He...

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:30.040
Even if I agree to you,
and he were spared...

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.840
...he is not the type
who would be pleased by it.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.380
Besides...

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:39.750
...Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi have
done their best and traveled with me.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:44.980
They guarded me with their lives as
I was conversing with the Rune-God.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.290
I cannot desert them and
agree to an unfair dealing by myself!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.660
Then what will you do, Magic Knight?

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:54.300
I will defeat you...

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.700
...and I will rescue Ferio!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.830
Then you shall die!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:17:59.910
What?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.800
Legendary Magic Knight.

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:08.000
I have seen proof of
the strength of thine heart.

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:10.350
The Rune-God...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.550
T-This can't be...

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.090
Impossible...

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:20.050
And now I will wake from my
slumber and show thee my true self!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.470
This is the Rune-God?

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.060
This power is...

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.080
The armor...

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.690
The armor has evolved!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.390
The swords too.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.860
The swords evolved too!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.970
All three of us have matching outfits!

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.800
Legendary Magic Knight.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:15.040
Thine heart is not
yet ready to don me.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:20.410
Until the promised day comes,
I will change my appearance...

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:25.810
...become a part of thee,
and patiently wait.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:41.770
Until the promised day comes...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:49.210
Are you really all right now?

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.540
Yeah.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.250
You won't ever see me again.

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.550
I held you back.

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.960
So forget about me.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.870
You cannot mean that.
It is because of you...

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:12.340
...that I was able to defeat
Inouva and revive the Rune-God!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.640
Back then, you gave me...

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:16.870
I...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.140
I can't forgive myself.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.980
Think of Cephiro, not me...

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:27.910
Think about saving this world.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.880
I'm sure you guys can do it!

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:32.690
See ya!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.850
W-Wait a minute!

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:38.730
Really. He went off
without listening to a word.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.030
Ferio...

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:41.860
Fuu.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:48.210
I apologize.
I suddenly got teary-eyed.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.840
I cannot stop crying...

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:53.770
Fuu...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.110
Fuu, do you really want
to forget about Ferio?

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.580
No! No!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:07.280
Then it's okay to not forget him
and to keep thinking about him!

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:11.260
What happened today
definitely wasn't Ferio's fault.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.900
You want to see him
and talk this out, right?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.700
So if you wish for it long enough...

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:21.240
...I'm sure you'll see Ferio
again, and he'll understand.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.240
Because this world
is Cephiro, the land of will.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.770
Hikaru...

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:32.450
You are right, Ms. Hikaru.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:38.420
Because this is a world where
the believing heart turns into power.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.530
I beg your forgiveness, Lord Zagato.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.730
Please, I ask of you
to turn me back to my true self.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:54.970
That way, I am sure to...

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:56.300
I cannot.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.710
My lord!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02.780
Come forth, Lafarga!

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:32.610
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:39.780
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:46.780
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:51.360
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:56.830
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:59.470
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:04.370
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:12.040
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:18.050
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:25.230
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:31.170
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:49.850
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:54.790
Miss Umi was suddenly abducted
by a monster with huge wings.

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:58.190
We could not do anything about it...

00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:00.990
...but were saved by
someone very good with swords.

00:24:01.100 --> 00:24:03.130
His name was Lafarga.

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:07.170
But we are not sure
why he saved Ms. Umi.

00:24:07.610 --> 00:24:09.630
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:10.840
A Powerful Foe!
Lafarga the Swordmaster.

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:12.240
A Powerful Foe!
Lafarga the Swordmaster
A Powerful Foe!
Lafarga the Swordmaster.

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.850
A Powerful Foe!
Lafarga the Swordmaster
Please be sure to watch it!

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:21.780
Who is it today?

00:24:22.860 --> 00:24:24.760
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:25.820
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:25.820 --> 00:24:28.590
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:28.590 --> 00:24:30.820
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!
